					<description><![CDATA[NASA announced the purchase of multiple modes of transportation to the Moon’s surface and cis-lunar space to help establish an understanding of what’s needed to execute on their Moon Base program agenda. <a class="mh-excerpt-more" href="https://spaceflightnow.com/2026/11/23/nasa-seeks-to-begin-intergalactic-freight-network-with-1-3-billion-block-purchase-of-rockets-orbital-transfer-vehicles/" title="NASA seeks to begin ‘intergalactic freight network’ with $1.3 billion block purchase of rockets, orbital transfer vehicles"></a>]]></description>
										
					
		
		
